cl-qos/align-watermark-flow-with-port-configuration-hld/", "title": "flexcounter \u306e queue/PG map \u751f\u6210\u3068 watermark \u6709\u52b9\u5316\u306e\u6574\u5408", "content_html": "flexcounter \u306e queue/PG map \u751f\u6210\u3068 watermark \u6709\u52b9\u5316\u306e\u6574\u5408 \u2014 SONiC \u306e flex counter \u306b\u306f queue counter / PG-drop counter / watermark counter (queue / PG / buffer-pool) \u304c\u4e26\u5217\u306b\u5b58\u5728\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/align-watermark-flow-with-port-configuration-hld.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-02T00:22:43+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T15:53:12+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/asymmetric-pfc-test-plan/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/asymmetric-pfc-test-plan/", "title": "Asymmetric PFC \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08PTF + sonic-mgmt fixtures\uff09", "content_html": "Asymmetric PFC \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08PTF + sonic-mgmt fixtures\uff09 \u2014 Asymmetric PFC \u306f SONiC \u6a5f\u80fd\u3060\u304c\u3001\u672c\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u306f\u305d\u306e \u6a5f\u80fd\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u8a08\u753b \u3092\u6271\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/asymmetric-pfc-test-plan.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-02T00:22:43+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T18:07:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/configurable-drop-counters-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/configurable-drop-counters-in-sonic/", "title": "\u8a2d\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u306a Drop Counter\uff08DEBUG_COUNTER \u3068 SAI debug counter\uff09", "content_html": "\u8a2d\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u306a Drop Counter\uff08DEBUG_COUNTER \u3068 SAI debug counter\uff09 \u2014 SAI debug counter \u3092\u6d3b\u7528\u3057\u3001\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u304c\u30c9\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7\u7406\u7531\uff08drop reason\uff09\u306e\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3092\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3057\u3066\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3059\u308b\u6a5f\u80fd\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/configurable-drop-counters-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-02T00:22:43+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:04:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/copp-manager-redesign-test-plan/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/copp-manager-redesign-test-plan/", "title": "CoPP Manager \u518d\u8a2d\u8a08\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08feature \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u6574\u5408\u6027 + always_enabled\uff09", "content_html": "CoPP Manager \u518d\u8a2d\u8a08\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08feature \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u6574\u5408\u6027 + always_enabled\uff09 \u2014 CoppMgr \u306f CONFIG_DB \u306e COPP_TRAP \u3068 FEATURE \u3092\u89b3\u6e2c\u3057\u3001\u5404 trap (BGP / ARP / LACP / UDLD / IP2ME \u7b49) \u3092 SAI host\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/copp-manager-redesign-test-plan.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-02T00:22:43+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:38:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/copp-neighbor-miss-trap-and-enhancements/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/copp-neighbor-miss-trap-and-enhancements/", "title": "CoPP Neighbor Miss trap \u3068 enum capability query\uff08show copp configuration\uff09", "content_html": "CoPP Neighbor Miss trap \u3068 enum capability query\uff08show copp configuration\uff09 \u2014 CoPP \u306b neighbor_miss trap\uff08ARP/ND \u672a\u89e3